<div class="page">
  <header style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">Delaware County Extension Master Gardener Meeting (<span data-field="meeting_date">{{ meeting_date }}</span>)</h1>
  </header>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <img src="placeholder_image.png" alt="Speaker Photo" style="width: 100%; height: auto; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
    </div>
    <div style="width: 65%;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 20pt; margin-top: 0;">Home Hydroponics</h2>
      <p>Speaker: <span data-field="speaker_name">{{ speaker_name }}</span></p>
      <p>Assistant Professor and Extension Specialist</p>
      <p>Department of Horticulture and Landscape Architecture, Purdue University</p>
      <p>Tel: <span data-field="speaker_phone">{{ speaker_phone }}</span></p>
      <p>E-mail: <span data-field="speaker_email">{{ speaker_email }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 80px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
      <img src="placeholder_purdue_logo.png" alt="Purdue Logo" style="height: 40px; margin-right: 10px;">
      <span style="font-size: 12pt;">PURDUE UNIVERSITY</span>
      <span style="font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 5px;">Extension</span>
    </div>
    <div style="font-size: 10pt;">|</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <header style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">What is Hydroponics?</h1>
  </header>

  <p style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.6;">Hydroponics is the science of growing plants without soil, but in water enriched with nutrients and oxygen</p>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 50px;">
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <img src="placeholder_image_a.png" alt="Forced Aeration" style="width: 45%;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 10px;">Forced aeration</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <img src="placeholder_image_b.png" alt="No Aeration" style="width: 45%;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 10px;">No aeration</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <img src="placeholder_image_c.png" alt="All Nutrients" style="width: 45%;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 10px;">All nutrients</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <img src="placeholder_image_d.png" alt="Only Major Nutrients" style="width: 45%;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 10px;">Only major nutrients</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px; text-align: center; font-size: 10pt;">
    (Hoagland and Arnon, 1950)
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 80px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end;">
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
      <img src="placeholder_purdue_logo.png" alt="Purdue Logo" style="height: 30px; margin-right: 10px;">
      <span style="font-size: 10pt;">PURDUE UNIVERSITY</span>
      <span style="font-size: 8pt; margin-left: 5px;">Extension</span>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">1/1/2021 | 2</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <header style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">Hydroponics is not a new method</h1>
  </header>

  <p style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.6;">Woodward (1699) grew spearmint in rain, river, and conduit water</p>

  <p style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.6;">It was believed that soil (somehow) provided everything needed for organic growth of plants</p>

  <p style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.6;">Once it was recognized that soil is needed to supply certain chemicals and water, researchers attempted to grow plants with without soil</p>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 60px;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
        <img src="placeholder_purdue_logo.png" alt="Purdue Logo" style="height: 30px; margin-right: 10px;">
        <span style="font-size: 10pt;">PURDUE UNIVERSITY</span>
        <span style="font-size: 8pt; margin-left: 5px;">Extension</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
      <img src="placeholder_image_sachs.png" alt="Julius von Sachs" style="width: 150px; height: auto;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; text-align: right;">Julius von Sachs, 1887</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 80px; text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">1/1/2021 | 3</div>
</div>

